"Instructor Pa-weeq is an Artonan who teaches A History of Artonan Life at the Chicago consulate."
"Pa-weeq teaches by magic screen from Artona I, in another universe, with no lag."
"Pa-weeq's voice could pass for human."
"Pa-weeq has sharp bones, a prominent forehead and pale brown skin with a violet undertone."
"Pa-weeq has midnight blue facial tattoos."
"Pa-weeq's course includes a two-hour session on irrigation."
"Pa-weeq said some Artonan communities think serving wevvi to guests is important."
